Modifications: of the 3,336,716 records in the August 2026 file, the
3,336,701 picked up in August 2026 are kept (15 dated outside the month are
left out); of each, only the pickup and drop-off zone, the hour of the
pickup and the metered fare (rounded to the cent) are kept. The zone shapes
are reprojected from New York State Plane Long Island (EPSG:2263) to
longitude and latitude, simplified by about two metres and given the
service zone from the lookup table; the two lookup ids without a shape
(264, unknown, and 265, outside New York City) have no zone, so the trips
that name them do not draw. The map's SQL counts the trips between every
pair of zones, both ways together, in five parts of the day, and draws a
pair that saw at least 31 trips in that part of the day.


